<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13105] Spring data 2.0 IgniteRepositoryQuery#transformQueryCursor contains cursor leak</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13105</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This code produce cursor leak in RunningQueryManager:&lt;br/&gt;
If result set contains one ore more rows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; ONE_VALUE:
                    Iterator&amp;lt;List&amp;gt; iter = qryIter.iterator();

                    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (iter.hasNext())
                        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; iter.next().get(0);

                    &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
